  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "✨ Welcome to Happy Sol – Your 30A Getaway on the West End! ✨<br><br>Nestled on the highly desirable west end of Highway 30A, Happy Sol is the perfect blend of coastal luxury, family-friendly fun, and unbeatable convenience. With multiple public beach access points just a short walk away, you can be on the sugar-white sands and emerald waters of the Gulf of Mexico in minutes.<br><br>🏡 Property Highlights<br><br>6 Spacious Bedrooms<br><br>6.5 Bathrooms<br><br>Private Pool + Hot Tub<br><br>Top-Floor Balcony with Stunning Gulf & Coastal Dune Lake Views<br><br>Multiple Arcade1Up Machines (Pac-Man, Golden Tee, Fast & Furious + more!)<br><br>A 6-passenger, gas-powered, street-legal golf cart is included with the rental. Guests are required to complete and sign a waiver through the rental provider, Liv Adventures, prior to use.<br><br>Step inside and enjoy a beautifully designed home ideal for families, groups, and multi-generational vacations. The open living spaces, coastal décor, and inviting layout make it easy to relax and reconnect.<br><br>🎮 Fun for All Ages<br><br>Kids and adults love the Arcade1Up gaming area featuring classics like Pac-Man, Golden Tee, and Fast & Furious. Whether it’s a rainy-day activity or late-night fun, this space is always a hit.<br><br>🌊 Outdoor Oasis<br><br>Unwind in your private pool and hot tub, or soak in the sun on comfortable loungers. After a day at the beach, enjoy sunset views from the top-floor balcony overlooking both the Gulf of Mexico and a rare coastal dune lake.<br><br>🌴 Prime 30A Location<br><br>Happy Sol places you close to the best of 30A’s west end:<br><br>Gulf Place – dining, shops, live music, and events<br><br>Stinky’s Fish Camp – a local favorite for fresh seafood<br><br>Shunk Gulley – Gulf-view dining and great vibes<br><br>Whether you’re seeking a peaceful beach escape, a fun-filled family adventure, or easy access to 30A’s best restaurants and entertainment, Happy Sol delivers it all.<br><br>SLEEPING ARRANGEMENTS<br><br>This spacious home offers 6 beautifully appointed bedrooms—each with its own private ensuite bathroom—along with additional sleeping options to comfortably accommodate large groups and families.<br><br>FIRST FLOOR<br>King Bedroom: 1 King bed with private ensuite bath and 1 twin bunk bed.<br>Bunk Room: 2 Bunk beds with private ensuite bath (Two Twins and 2 Fulls, totalling 4 beds)<br>Pool Area Living Room: 2 Queen sleeper sofas for extra guests<br><br>SECOND FLOOR<br>King Bedroom: 1 King bed with private ensuite bath<br>King Bedroom: 1 King bed with private ensuite bath<br><br>THIRD FLOOR<br>King Bedroom: 1 King bed with private ensuite bath<br>King Bedroom: 1 King bed with private ensuite bath<br><br>FOURTH FLOOR<br>Small air conditioned sitting area with expansive water view roof top patio.<br><br>*With six ensuite bedrooms and plenty of room to spread out, this home is perfect for multi-family vacations, group getaways, and guests seeking comfort, privacy, and convenience.<br><br><br>**All bookings require a signed rental agreement, a copy of a government issued photo ID that matches the credit card and the agreement, and a $500.00 security deposit hold (Rental agreement must be signed within 48 hours of booking, or the reservation will be subject to cancellation.)<br>** No Smoking<br>** No Parties or Events<br>** No pets<br>** Must be at least 25 years old to rent and the person booking must stay in the property through the duration of the rental.<br>** There must be one adult 25 or older present for every 3 guests under the age of 25.<br>**Parking available for 5 cars.<br>**Pool can be heated from Nov 1 - April 31 for an additional $75 a day fee. Please inquire, as this must be arranged three days before arrival. Hot Tub use is complimentary.<br>**This home includes a residential elevator provided as a courtesy. Please note that residential elevators can be prone to occasional service issues or malfunction. While every effort will be made to ensure it remains operational, its function and availability during your stay cannot be guaranteed.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
